 "Iron nail":{group:"Metal",lustre:"Shiny when clean",hardness:"Hard",malleability:"Can be shaped when processed",ductility:"Can be drawn into wire in suitable forms",conductivity:"Conducts heat and electricity",use:"Nails and tools"},
 "Copper wire":{group:"Metal",lustre:"Reddish and lustrous",hardness:"Medium-hard",malleability:"Can be shaped",ductility:"Very ductile",conductivity:"Very good electrical conductor",use:"Electrical wiring"},
